# Real OSC command blocks: exit gutters, duration and hovered output copy.
size 90x27
dpr 1
search-terminal
overlay blocks
render-terminal
expect-ink-px 10:16-720:110 1% 99%
screenshot blocks-1x
overlay-hover-block
render-terminal
screenshot blocks-hover-1x
dpr 2
search-terminal
overlay blocks
render-terminal
expect-ink-px 20:32-1440:220 1% 99%
screenshot blocks-2x
overlay-hover-block
render-terminal
screenshot blocks-hover-2x
